<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-5 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">About Mach24 Orbital</h2>
  <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    <strong class="font-semibold text-[#111827]">Mach24 Orbital</strong> plans and coordinates satellite deployment operations, where every launch window depends on dozens of interdependent checks &mdash; vehicle readiness, orbital timing, ground systems, and weather &mdash; all lining up correctly.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-4 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">The challenge</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Coordinating a launch meant manually cross-referencing checklists, schedules, and readiness reports scattered across teams. Any single missed dependency could push a launch window back by days or weeks.
  </p>
  <div class="rounded-2xl border border-red-200 bg-red-50 p-6">
    <p class="mb-2 font-medium text-[#111827]">Key pain points:</p>
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">
      <li>&bull; Launch prep required manually cross-checking dozens of readiness items</li>
      <li>&bull; Scheduling conflicts between teams surfaced late, not early</li>
      <li>&bull; A single missed dependency could delay a launch window</li>
      <li>&bull; Readiness status lived across separate systems and spreadsheets</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-4 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">The solution</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Mach24 Orbital integrated Zunkiree's AI systems to pull readiness data from every team into a single view, flag scheduling conflicts automatically, and surface dependency gaps before they became blockers.
  </p>
  <div class="space-y-3">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle">
      <p class="mb-1 font-medium text-[#111827]">Unified readiness view</p>
      <p class="text-[13.5px] text-[#6B7280]">Status from every team feeds into a single, continuously updated readiness picture for each launch window.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle">
      <p class="mb-1 font-medium text-[#111827]">Automated conflict detection</p>
      <p class="text-[13.5px] text-[#6B7280]">Scheduling conflicts between teams and systems are flagged as soon as they appear, not discovered at review time.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle">
      <p class="mb-1 font-medium text-[#111827]">Dependency tracking</p>
      <p class="text-[13.5px] text-[#6B7280]">Every readiness item is tracked against what it depends on, so gaps surface early enough to fix.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-4 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">The results</h2>
